---
import "./why-anikawa.css";
---

<section class="why-anikawa-section">
  <div class="why-anikawa-bg-glow"></div>

  <div class="why-anikawa-container">
    <div class="why-anikawa-header">
      <span class="why-anikawa-badge"> ✨ Trusted by Anime Fans </span>

      <h2 class="why-anikawa-title">
        Why Anime Fans Choose
        <span>AniKawa</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="why-anikawa-subtitle">
        Built for anime lovers who want a smoother, faster, and more enjoyable
        streaming experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-anikawa-grid">
      <div class="why-anikawa-card">
        <div class="why-anikawa-icon">📖</div>
        <h3>More Than Episode Lists</h3>
        <p>
          AniKawa helps you understand an anime before watching it with
          insights, recommendations, and detailed viewing guides.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-anikawa-card">
        <div class="why-anikawa-icon">⭐</div>
        <h3>Exclusive AniKawa Notes</h3>
        <p>
          Discover why an anime is worth watching, who will enjoy it, standout
          episodes, fun facts, and community opinions all in one place.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-anikawa-card">
        <div class="why-anikawa-icon">🚫</div>
        <h3>Distraction-Free Viewing</h3>
        <p>
          Enjoy a clean anime experience with no ads inside the video player and
          no interruptions while watching your favorite episodes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-anikawa-card">
        <div class="why-anikawa-icon">🎌</div>
        <h3>Deep Anime Discovery</h3>
        <p>
          Explore detailed genres, niche categories, themed collections, and
          similar anime recommendations beyond basic search results.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-anikawa-card">
        <div class="why-anikawa-icon">💜</div>
        <h3>Your Personal Anime Hub</h3>
        <p>
          Save anime to your watchlist, track viewing history, manage favorites,
          and continue your anime journey across all your devices.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-anikawa-content">
      <p>
        AniKawa combines anime streaming, discovery, and tracking in one place.
        Explore detailed anime guides, curated recommendations, watchlists,
        viewing history, community ratings, and exclusive AniKawa notes. With
        distraction-free episode pages and deep anime collections, AniKawa helps
        fans discover, organize, and enjoy anime without the clutter found on
        many traditional anime websites.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
